---
layout: layouts/base.njk
permalink: index.html
title: Restfest — ditt lilla kylskåpskök
description: Middag av det du redan har. Skriv in vad som finns i kylen och få receptförslag ur Restfests receptarkiv.
scripts: [kitchen.js, fridge-ai.js]
---
{#- The home page: a purple hero, then three steps with the same kind of heading (.step-heading):
    01 Inventera (the fridge list, and the fridge photo when it's turned on), 02 Matcha (tonight's dinner)
    and 03 Planera (a week of dinners, shown once the list matches enough recipes). "Så funkar det" at
    the bottom names the same three steps. -#}
  <main id="main" class="wrap kitchen-page">
    <section class="kitchen-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-heading">
      <div class="kitchen-hero-copy">
        <p class="eyebrow">RÄDDA RESTERNA</p>
        <h1 id="hero-heading">Vad blir det till middag i&nbsp;kväll?</h1>
        <p class="kitchen-hero-intro">Ett halvt paket crème&nbsp;fraiche, två morötter och en ensam paprika? Utgå från det du har hemma, hitta ett recept och se vad som saknas.</p>
        <button id="try-example" class="button primary" type="button">Prova ett exempel <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
      </div>
      <div class="kitchen-hero-art" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="assets/illustrations/noodles.svg" width="1176" height="1175" alt="">
      </div>
    </section>

    <div class="kitchen-grid">
      <section class="kitchen-step" id="borja" aria-labelledby="fridge-title">
        <div class="step-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">01 · INVENTERA</p><h2 id="fridge-title">Vad finns i kylen?</h2></div>
        </div>
        {#- Two ways in, side by side from 800px (the photo first on phones), and the list they both fill below. #}
        <div class="inventory">
          <div class="inventory-inputs{{ ' has-photo' if ai.functionsUrl }}">
            <div class="add-card">
              <h3>Lägg till vad som finns hemma</h3>
              <p id="add-help" class="card-intro">Lägg till en råvara i taget från kyl, frys eller skafferi.</p>
              <form id="pantry-form" class="pantry-form">
                <label class="sr-only" for="ingredient-input">Lägg till råvara</label>
                <input id="ingredient-input" maxlength="80" list="ingredient-options" placeholder="T.ex. pasta" autocomplete="off" aria-describedby="add-help">
                <datalist id="ingredient-options"></datalist>
                <button class="button primary" type="submit">Lägg till råvara <i class="fas fa-plus" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
              </form>
            </div>
            {%- if ai.functionsUrl %}
            {#- The fridge photo: Claude lists the foods it sees and they go into the list. Without `capture`,
                phones offer both the camera and the photo library. src/js/fridge-ai.js #}
            <div class="photo-card" id="fota">
              <div class="photo-card-body">
                <div class="photo-card-copy">
                  <h3>Ta en bild av ditt kylskåp</h3>
                  <p class="card-intro">Ta 1–3 bilder av kylskåpet, frysen eller skafferiet, och så letar vi upp vilka råvaror de innehåller – och du slipper inventera.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="photo-card-art" aria-hidden="true">
                  <img src="assets/illustrations/fridge-viewfinder.svg" width="1133" height="1123" alt="">
                </div>
                <div class="photo-actions">
                  <button id="fridge-photo" class="button primary" type="button"><i class="fas fa-camera" aria-hidden="true"></i><span>Fota eller välj bilder</span></button>
                  <input id="fridge-photo-input" type="file" accept="image/*" multiple hidden>
                </div>
              </div>
            </div>
            {%- endif %}
          </div>
          <div class="pantry-panel is-empty">
            <div class="pane-heading">
              <h3>Det här finns hemma redan</h3>
              <span id="pantry-count" class="count" aria-live="polite">0</span>
            </div>
            <p id="pantry-help" class="pantry-help">Inget här än.</p>
            <ul id="pantry-list" class="pantry-list" aria-label="Dina råvaror"></ul>
            <ul id="pantry-unknown" class="pantry-unknown" aria-label="Råvaror som inte känns igen" hidden></ul>
            <div class="pantry-footer">
              <p id="pantry-status" class="meta" role="status"></p>
              <button id="clear-pantry" class="text-button" type="button" hidden>Rensa listan</button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="kitchen-step" id="recept" aria-labelledby="tonight-title">
        <div class="step-heading">
          <div><p class="eyebrow">02 · MATCHA</p><h2 id="tonight-title">Laga ikväll</h2></div>
          <a class="text-button" href="receptarkiv.html">Receptarkivet <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></a>
        </div>
        <p id="match-status" class="sr-only" role="status"></p>
        <div id="featured-recipe"></div>
        {%- if ai.functionsUrl %}
        {#- Shown once the list has something the site recognises. src/js/fridge-ai.js #}
        <section id="invent-recipe" class="invent-recipe" aria-labelledby="invent-title" hidden>
          <img src="assets/icons/cooking-pot.svg" width="48" height="48" alt="">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">NYTT RECEPT</p>
            <h3 id="invent-title">Inget som lockar?</h3>
            <p>Låt Claude hitta på en ny middag av det som finns i din lista. Receptet tar ungefär en halv minut, fotot en stund till.</p>
            <button id="invent-button" class="button primary" type="button">Hitta på ett recept <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            <p id="invent-status" class="meta invent-status" role="status"></p>
          </div>
        </section>
        {%- endif %}
      </section>

      <section id="vecka" class="kitchen-step week-plan" aria-labelledby="week-title" hidden>
        <div class="step-heading">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">03 · PLANERA</p>
            <h2 id="week-title">Middagar ur kylen</h2>
          </div>
          <div class="week-actions">
            <button id="week-refresh" class="text-button" type="button">Ny vecka <i class="fas fa-arrow-up-right" aria-hidden="true"></i></button>
            <button id="week-shop" class="button primary" type="button">Lägg saknade i inköpslistan</button>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p id="week-intro" class="week-intro"></p>
        <ul id="week-list" class="match-list"></ul>
      </section>
    </div>

    <section id="sa-funkar-det" class="how-section" aria-labelledby="how-heading">
      <div class="how-heading"><p class="eyebrow">FRÅN KYL TILL KVÄLLSMAT</p><h2 id="how-heading">Så funkar det</h2></div>
      <ol class="steps">
        <li>
          <img src="assets/illustrations/fridge-opened.svg" width="878" height="1121" alt="">
          <p class="eyebrow">01 · INVENTERA</p>
          <h3>Vad har du?</h3>
          <p>{{ 'Skriv in eller fota det som finns i kyl, frys och skafferi, eller prova exempelkylskåpet.' if ai.functionsUrl else 'Skriv in det som finns i kyl, frys och skafferi, eller prova exempelkylskåpet.' }}</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="assets/illustrations/cook-book.svg" width="733" height="881" alt="">
          <p class="eyebrow">02 · MATCHA</p>
          <h3>Hitta ett recept.</h3>
          <p>Du får de middagar som passar bäst, ser vad som saknas och bockar av råvarorna medan du lagar.</p>
        </li>
        <li>
          <img src="assets/illustrations/serving-cloche.svg" width="1145" height="1059" alt="">
          <p class="eyebrow">03 · PLANERA</p>
          <h3>Planera veckan.</h3>
          <p>Fyra middagar som delar på det du behöver köpa, med det som saknas i inköpslistan.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </section>
  </main>
